# Rank 1602 / CVE-2023-30839: PrestaShop's database helper enforced
# its SELECT-only contract only in development mode, so in
# production any caller sliding a write statement through the read
# API had it executed verbatim (SQL injection escalation through a
# dev-only guard, CWE-89/CWE-964; GHSA-p379-cxqh-q822). executeS in
# classes/db/Db.php detected non-select statements and did `if
# (defined('_PS_MODE_DEV_') && _PS_MODE_DEV_) { throw new
# PrestaShopDatabaseException('Db->executeS() must be used only
# with select, show, explain or describe queries'); } return
# $this->execute($sql, $use_cache);` -- the production path runs the
# statement. The fixing commit d1d27dc371 (
# the GHSA merge, "Fix executeS method making sure it does selection
# only"): the conditional and the fallthrough are deleted; the
# method always throws on a non-selection statement. No pool
# correction.
#
# ATTENTION, mode-conditional enforcement. The guard exists and
# detects the violation -- its throw is wrapped in a
# development-mode conditional, the same release-mode-guard family
# as rank 1543 (orjson's debug_assert): no rule can ask "is this
# check compiled out or bypassed in production configurations" --
# mode-conditionality of guards is environment vocabulary. A
# binding on PrestaShop's own executeS would detect this platform
# rather than the weakness. Measured on the real code: scanning
# classes/db/Db.php reports zero findings at both revisions. No
# ENGINE-GAPS.md entry. No definition change shipped. Spec
# cve_rank1602 records the dev-only throw with its execute
# fallthrough and the unconditional form, both asserting reject
# VYQL-INJ-001: when guard-mode vocabulary lands, the conditional
# form must flip to expect.

test "rank1602: the select-only check throws in dev mode alone"
  lang php
  file classes/db/Db.php
  reject VYQL-INJ-001
  code
  ```
  <?php

  class Db
  {
      public function executeS($sql, $use_cache = true)
      {
          if (!preg_match('/^\s*(select|show|explain|describe)\s/i', $sql)) {
              if (defined('_PS_MODE_DEV_') && _PS_MODE_DEV_) {
                  throw new PrestaShopDatabaseException('Db->executeS() must be used only with select, show, explain or describe queries');
              }

              return $this->execute($sql, $use_cache);
          }

          return $this->query($sql);
      }
  }
  ```

test "rank1602: the fixed revision always refuses non-selection statements"
  lang php
  file classes/db/Db.php
  reject VYQL-INJ-001
  code
  ```
  <?php

  class Db
  {
      public function executeS($sql, $use_cache = true)
      {
          if (!preg_match('/^\s*(select|show|explain|describe)\s/i', $sql)) {
              throw new PrestaShopDatabaseException('Db->executeS() must be used only with select, show, explain or describe queries');
          }

          return $this->query($sql);
      }
  }
  ```
